Learnt about AWS EC2 instances and Scripts:-

AWS EC2 (Elastic Compute Cloud) instances are scalable virtual servers in the cloud that allow you to rent computing 
capacity with full root control. 
They provide a pay-as-you-go pricing model and support multiple operating systems like Linux, Windows, and macOS.

Scripts:- 

Scripts in DevOps serve as the glue that automates manual, repetitive tasks across development, infrastructure, 
testing, and deployment workflows. 
Instead of executing commands one by one, engineers bundle them into code to achieve speed, consistency, and scale.

Also, Scripts has to make an API call with AWS with a request that is matching all this criteria that is valid, authenticated , 
and authorized and as a output for the script you will get an EC2 instances.
